# Ferenginar's same {T} ability can choose green instead; it enters tapped and gains 1 life before it untaps (CR 614.1d, 603.6a, 119.3, 602.2b, 605.1a, 605.3b, 106.4).

[Bot1 Deck]
Ferenginar
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ferenginar.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ferenginar.Tapped = true
! Bot1.Battlefield.Ferenginar.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 21
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ferenginar.Activate(Color: Green)
? Bot1.Mana = {G}
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ferenginar.Tapped = true

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 21
Bot1.Mana = {G}
Bot1.Battlefield.Ferenginar.Tapped = true
